]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe pivot columns correspond to basis vectors, while the non-pivot columns correspond to linearly dependent vectors that can be removed. Here, the reduced matrix has $3$ pivot columns (or alternatively, it has exactly $3$ non-zero rows). \n\nTherefore, the dimension of the span is $3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-35299/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "004c4177-ca0e-586c-962a-1220b4b64f47"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-35299"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-79313/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "bab82802-6085-5503-b4fb-51786c4d1e74" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-79313/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "106f7333-24fa-5439-8d27-9c68d8bfc544" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-79313/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "930863fc-491c-5746-a597-629228754232" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-79313/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "98d49020-8876-5ba0-88ed-a09aff3b042f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-79313/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "cb6269d4-64ec-5f6c-9af7-fdc4aabe68a0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-79313/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "dd24a302-597c-53b5-8fd6-47ea7529e3e5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-79313/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3